{
    "title": "CLZ Comics comic book database",
    "description": "Easily catalog your comic collection. \r\nJust scan comic barcodes. Or search by title and checkbox the issues you own. \r\nAutomatic issue details, key info, cover art and creator lists.\r\n\r\nCLZ Comics is a paid subscription app, costing US $1.99 per month or US $19.99 per year.\r\nUse the free 7-day trial to try all of the app's features and online services!\r\nOptional: Get comic values from CovrPrice at US $60 extra per year.\r\n\r\nTHREE EASY WAYS TO CATALOG COMIC BOOKS:\r\n1. Scan barcodes with the built-in camera scanner. Guaranteed 99% success rate.\r\n2. Find a series by title, then checkbox the issues you own\r\n3. Search a specific issue by title and issue number\r\n\r\nAUTOMATIC FULL COMIC DETAILS FROM CLZ CORE:\r\nOur CLZ Core online comic database automatically provides cover art and full comic details, like Series, Issue Nr, Publisher, plot, creator lists, character lists, backdrop art, etc... \r\nPlus, it will automatically provide key comic information, like first appearances, deaths, cameo appearances, first team appearances, origins, iconic cover art, etc...\r\n\r\nEDIT ALL FIELDS:\r\nYou can edit all automatically provided details from CLZ Core, like the series, issue number, variant description, release/cover dates, plot descriptions, creator and character listings etc.. you can even upload your own cover art (front and back!). You can also add personal details like storage box, grade, slab label types, purchase date / price / store, notes, etc.. \r\n\r\nCREATE MULTIPLE COLLECTIONS:\r\nCollections will appear as Excel-like tabs at the bottom of your screen. E.g. for different people, to separate physical from digital comics, to keep track of comics you sold or have for sale, etc... \r\n\r\nOPTIONAL: GET COMIC VALUES FROM COVRPRICE:\r\nOptional in-app purchase, at US $60 per year. Get accurate and up-to-date comic values from CovrPrice, for both raw and slabbed comics.\r\n\r\nUSE CLZ CLOUD TO:\r\n* Always have an online backup of your comic tracker database.\r\n* Sync your comic library between multiple devices\r\n* View and share your comic collection online\r\n\r\nGOT A QUESTION OR NEED HELP?\r\nWe are always ready to help or to answer your questions, 7 days a week.\r\nJust use \"Contact Support\" or \"CLZ Club forum\" from the menu.\r\n\r\nOTHER CLZ APPS:\r\n* CLZ Movies, for cataloging your DVDs, Blu-rays and 4K UHDs\r\n* CLZ Books, for organizing your book collection by ISBN\r\n* CLZ Music, for creating a database of your CDs and vinyl records\r\n* CLZ Games, for making a database of your video game collection\r\n\r\nABOUT COLLECTORZ / CLZ\r\nCLZ has been developing collection database software since 1996. Located in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, the CLZ team now consists of 12 guys and one gal. We're always working to bring you regular updates for the apps and software, and to keep our Core online databases up-to-date with all weekly releases.\r\n\r\nCLZ USERS ABOUT CLZ COMICS:\r\n\r\n* I love this app\r\n\"Perfect for a comic collector! Well worth the yearly price! And it keeps getting better!\"\r\nKari P (USA)\r\n \r\n* Best Comic Collection App in the Universe\r\n\"This is amazing. I access to my entire comic collection in my pocket or on the web. It\u2019s easy to use and makes collecting fun! The integration with CovrPrice puts this at app on a whole new level. Highly recommended!\"\r\nddulek (USA)\r\n \r\n* Great app and even better customer support\r\n\"I have been using the app to catalog my close to 1500 comics. I just recently signed up for CovrPrice which works in conjunction with CLZ to give you values of your raw and graded comics.  \r\nCustomer support is very prompt at resolving any issues or questions u may have.\"\r\nMichael Almanza (USA)\r\n \r\n* Easy to use\r\n\"Awesome program, easy to add comics, syncs the comic inventory to servers so you never lose your collection. highly recommend!\"\r\nA BoMb (USA)\r\n \r\n* Extremely well built app\r\n\"Excellent customer service and prompt reactions to customer feedback and requests. Constantly on the forefront of the needs and flexibility for the customer. This app and team ROCKS!!!\"\r\nCount Dracul (USA)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Easily catalog your comic collection. <br>Just scan comic barcodes. Or search by title and checkbox the issues you own. <br>Automatic issue details, key info, cover art and creator lists.<br><br>CLZ Comics is a paid subscription app, costing US $1.99 per month or US $19.99 per year.<br>Use the free 7-day trial to try all of the app&#39;s features and online services!<br>Optional: Get comic values from CovrPrice at US $60 extra per year.<br><br>THREE EASY WAYS TO CATALOG COMIC BOOKS:<br>1. Scan barcodes with the built-in camera scanner. Guaranteed 99% success rate.<br>2. Find a series by title, then checkbox the issues you own<br>3. Search a specific issue by title and issue number<br><br>AUTOMATIC FULL COMIC DETAILS FROM CLZ CORE:<br>Our CLZ Core online comic database automatically provides cover art and full comic details, like Series, Issue Nr, Publisher, plot, creator lists, character lists, backdrop art, etc... <br>Plus, it will automatically provide key comic information, like first appearances, deaths, cameo appearances, first team appearances, origins, iconic cover art, etc...<br><br>EDIT ALL FIELDS:<br>You can edit all automatically provided details from CLZ Core, like the series, issue number, variant description, release/cover dates, plot descriptions, creator and character listings etc.. you can even upload your own cover art (front and back!). You can also add personal details like storage box, grade, slab label types, purchase date / price / store, notes, etc.. <br><br>CREATE MULTIPLE COLLECTIONS:<br>Collections will appear as Excel-like tabs at the bottom of your screen. E.g. for different people, to separate physical from digital comics, to keep track of comics you sold or have for sale, etc... <br><br>OPTIONAL: GET COMIC VALUES FROM COVRPRICE:<br>Optional in-app purchase, at US $60 per year. Get accurate and up-to-date comic values from CovrPrice, for both raw and slabbed comics.<br><br>USE CLZ CLOUD TO:<br>* Always have an online backup of your comic tracker database.<br>* Sync your comic library between multiple devices<br>* View and share your comic collection online<br><br>GOT A QUESTION OR NEED HELP?<br>We are always ready to help or to answer your questions, 7 days a week.<br>Just use &quot;Contact Support&quot; or &quot;CLZ Club forum&quot; from the menu.<br><br>OTHER CLZ APPS:<br>* CLZ Movies, for cataloging your DVDs, Blu-rays and 4K UHDs<br>* CLZ Books, for organizing your book collection by ISBN<br>* CLZ Music, for creating a database of your CDs and vinyl records<br>* CLZ Games, for making a database of your video game collection<br><br>ABOUT COLLECTORZ / CLZ<br>CLZ has been developing collection database software since 1996. Located in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, the CLZ team now consists of 12 guys and one gal. We&#39;re always working to bring you regular updates for the apps and software, and to keep our Core online databases up-to-date with all weekly releases.<br><br>CLZ USERS ABOUT CLZ COMICS:<br><br>* I love this app<br>&quot;Perfect for a comic collector! Well worth the yearly price! And it keeps getting better!&quot;<br>Kari P (USA)<br> <br>* Best Comic Collection App in the Universe<br>&quot;This is amazing. I access to my entire comic collection in my pocket or on the web. It\u2019s easy to use and makes collecting fun! The integration with CovrPrice puts this at app on a whole new level. Highly recommended!&quot;<br>ddulek (USA)<br> <br>* Great app and even better customer support<br>&quot;I have been using the app to catalog my close to 1500 comics. I just recently signed up for CovrPrice which works in conjunction with CLZ to give you values of your raw and graded comics.  <br>Customer support is very prompt at resolving any issues or questions u may have.&quot;<br>Michael Almanza (USA)<br> <br>* Easy to use<br>&quot;Awesome program, easy to add comics, syncs the comic inventory to servers so you never lose your collection. highly recommend!&quot;<br>A BoMb (USA)<br> <br>* Extremely well built app<br>&quot;Excellent customer service and prompt reactions to customer feedback and requests. Constantly on the forefront of the needs and flexibility for the customer. This app and team ROCKS!!!&quot;<br>Count Dracul (USA)",
